@anon.42b86dac05eb578258e9e0f4074366cb.149 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [486 x i8] }> <{ [486 x i8] c"The project's development dependencies.\0A\0ADevelopment dependencies will be installed by default in `uv run` and `uv sync`, but will\0Anot appear in the project's published metadata.\0A\0AUse of this field is not recommend anymore. Instead, use the `dependency-groups.dev` field\0Awhich is a standardized way to declare development dependencies. The contents of\0A`tool.uv.dev-dependencies` and `dependency-groups.dev` are combined to determine the final\0Arequirements of the `dev` dependency group." }>, align 1
